    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct oral bioavailability measurement exists for the exact query molecule.",
    "The query differs from cefuroxime axetil in the C7 substituent (1-hydroxyethyl vs furan/methoxyimino acetamido) and the ester alkyl (acetoxymethyl vs 1-acetoxyethyl); impact on permeability and esterase stability is unmeasured.",
